## Startup check

After pulling the image as described in the [adding guide](../ADDING_NEW_CONTAINER_GUIDE.md), run on an allocated compute node:

```bash
ml load apptainer
apptainer exec --cleanenv __TOOL__.sif __SMOKE_SHELL__
```

On TSL, pull/download on software23 and use paths under the default-mounted `/hpc-home` or `/tsl` trees; do not add user `--bind` mounts. Record the image digest and runtime/node details when testing. The installed package list is at `/opt/container-info/conda-explicit.txt` inside the image.

